{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/presidio-analyzer","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:18:44.622Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/presidio-analyzer/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/presidio-analyzer/presidio-analyzer/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nPresidio is a context aware, pluggable and customizable data protection and PII data anonymization\nservice for text and images.\n\nThe Presidio analyzer is a Python based service for detecting PII entities in text.\n\n+ [GitHub Repo](https://github.com/data-privacy-stack/presidio)\n+ [Documentation](https://microsoft.github.io/presidio/analyzer/index.html)\n\n## Project transition and container registry update\n\nThe Presidio project is transitioning from a Microsoft-owned project to an\nindependent, community-governed open source project under the Data Privacy Stack\nGitHub organization. Its new repository is\n[github.com/data-privacy-stack/presidio](https://github.com/data-privacy-stack/presidio).\n\nNew Presidio Analyzer container releases are published to GitHub Container\nRegistry at\n[`ghcr.io/data-privacy-stack/presidio-analyzer`](https://github.com/orgs/data-privacy-stack/packages/container/package/presidio-analyzer).\nThis MCR repository remains available as a legacy location, but\n`mcr.microsoft.com/presidio-analyzer:latest` no longer represents the newest\nPresidio release. For quick tests, use\n`ghcr.io/data-privacy-stack/presidio-analyzer:latest`; for production, pin an\nexplicit GHCR release tag.\n\n## Featured tags\n\n+ `latest` - Legacy MCR tag. No longer updated with the latest Presidio version; use `ghcr.io/data-privacy-stack/presidio-analyzer:latest` or a pinned GHCR release tag instead.\n\n## Related repositories\n\n+ [Presidio Anonymizer](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-presidio-anonymizer)\n+ [Presidio Image Redactor](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-presidio-image-redactor)\n\n## Support\n\n- Before you submit an issue, please go over the [documentation](https://microsoft.github.io/presidio). \n  For general discussions, please use the [Github repo's discussion board](https://github.com/microsoft/presidio/discussions).\n- If you have a usage question, found a bug or have a suggestion for improvement, please file a [Github issue](https://github.com/microsoft/presidio/issues).\n- For other matters, please email [presidio@microsoft.com](mailto:presidio@microsoft.com).\n\n## License\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\nThe project is covered by MIT License. The detailed license text is available [here](https://github.com/Microsoft/presidio/blob/main/LICENSE)\n\nWarning: ***Presidio can help identify sensitive/PII data in un/structured text. However, because Presidio is using trained ML models, there is no guarantee that Presidio will find all sensitive information. Consequently, additional systems and protections should be employed.***","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-07-24T21:24:33.8021293+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"357K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"2.2.362","digest":"sha256:286e3fa7f3a7426e775e8564fe1870f1ba8f999d3ab8bbb8cc46a44355d9d6e9","pushed":"2026-03-15T13:46:04.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:286e3fa7f3a7426e775e8564fe1870f1ba8f999d3ab8bbb8cc46a44355d9d6e9","pushed":"2026-03-15T13:46:02.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"2.2.361","digest":"sha256:7e0d954193e820bc3b63e11af4897887ffa88639e368b1e252051f38e3c714cb","pushed":"2026-02-12T09